; A hanging external centerline whose stations are named after the ones in
; survex_simple.svx. Nothing fixes it and nothing ties it in, so cavern warns
; "Survey not all connected to fixed stations" and drops it exactly as
; survex_hanging.svx is dropped — but every name it declares has a twin in the
; cave beside it, so the tie suggester has something to offer for a survey the
; solve placed nowhere at all.
*begin Simple
*data normal from to tape compass clino
A1 A2 10.0 0 0
A2 A3 8.5 90 0
*end Simple
